/T (So a simple question can take real effort. "What is the maximum tenure for a personal loan if my salary account is with the bank?" means finding the right scheme, opening its page and reading the right row of a table. A general chatbot can reply faster, but it may answer from memory, give no source and state a wrong figure with confidence. In lending, a wrong figure can lead to a wrong decision.)
