1434 0 obj
<<
/Title (Bank of Maharashtra publishes its loan information across many separate web pages and PDFs. This project's knowledge base alone covers 86 web pages and 3 PDF documents, holding 72,441 words and 115 tables. The details people care about most, such as rates, tenures, margins and fees, usually sit inside those tables, and they often depend on a condition such as the borrower's category, CIBIL score or where the salary account is held.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1350 0 R
/Next 1435 0 R
>>
endobj
1435 0 obj
<<
/Title (So a simple question can take real effort. "What is the maximum tenure for a personal loan if my salary account is with the bank?" means finding the right scheme, opening its page and reading the right row of a table. A general chatbot can reply faster, but it may answer from memory, give no source and state a wrong figure with confidence. In lending, a wrong figure can lead to a wrong decision.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1350 0 R
/Prev 1434 0 R
>>
endobj
